- Otherwise set answer_now to false and plan at most {{ max_tasks }} tasks that compute what is missing; list in facts any facts above that the answer also needs. Each brief asks one focused question about named columns of this dataset, and complete_when lists what the answer must contain.
- A brief's depends_on may name a task above whose results or published objects it needs (it loads an object instead of rebuilding it, e.g. a train/test split), or an earlier brief in your list.
- Plan only for this question, not for others it raises.
